    },
    "Gets everything recorded about one past Tesla drive: where it started and ended, when, how long and how far, battery at the start and end, energy used, efficiency, average and top speed, Autopilot miles, and temperatures. Leave the drive empty for the most recent drive, such as \"how was my last drive?\"." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obtiene todos los detalles de un viaje pasado: inicio, destino, duración, distancia, batería, energía, eficiencia, velocidad, Autopilot y temperaturas. Déjalo vacío para el último viaje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gets everything recorded about one Tesla charging session: where and when, Supercharger or AC, battery before and after, energy added and drawn from the charger, charging efficiency, range added, duration, and cost. Leave the session empty for the most recent charge, such as \"how much did my last charge cost?\"." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obtiene todos los detalles de una carga del Tesla: lugar, fecha, Supercharger o CA, batería, energía, eficiencia, autonomía, duración y costo. Déjalo vacío para la última carga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
