    "List Cars" : {
      "comment" : "FleetKit Siri/Shortcuts label from ListCarsIntent.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Listar vehículos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists the most recent completed drives for a Tesla vehicle, including start/end addresses, distance in miles, duration in minutes, average and max speed, and energy consumed in kWh. To filter drives by place, date, or distance, use Find Drives." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lista los últimos viajes completados de un Tesla con direcciones, distancia, duración, velocidad y energía. Usa Buscar viajes para filtrar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists the user's active cars by name, marks the default car, and returns each car's available controls. Pass a returned Vehicle to Control Car to target it, or omit Vehicle in Control Car to target the default car." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lista los vehículos activos por nombre, marca el predeterminado y muestra sus controles disponibles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists the user's past Tesla charging sessions, newest first, optionally only Superchargers or only AC, at a place (including saved nicknames), or within dates. Add a date range for older history. For one session in detail, use the Get Charge Details tool; for totals, the Get Charging Stats tool." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lista el historial de cargas del Tesla por tipo (Supercharger o CA), lugar (incluidos apodos guardados) o fechas. Añade un rango de fechas para historial más antiguo. Usa Ver detalles o Estadísticas de carga para más información."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists the user's past Tesla charging sessions, newest first, optionally only Superchargers or only AC, at a place, or within dates. Searches the connected provider’s charging history, including sessions too old for Spotlight. For one session in detail, use the Get Charge Details tool; for totals, the Get Charging Stats tool." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lista el historial de cargas del Tesla por tipo (Supercharger o CA), lugar o fechas. Usa Ver detalles o Estadísticas de carga para más información."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists the user's past Tesla drives by destination or starting place (including saved nicknames), date, distance, duration, or tag, sorted by most recent, longest, most energy, or most efficient. Add a date range for older history. For one drive in detail, use the Get Drive Details tool." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Busca viajes pasados del Tesla por lugar (incluidos apodos guardados), fecha, distancia, duración o etiqueta, ordenados a tu gusto. Añade un rango de fechas para historial más antiguo. Usa Ver detalles del viaje para uno específico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists the user's past Tesla drives by destination or starting place, date, distance, duration, or tag, sorted by most recent, longest, most energy, or most efficient. Searches the connected provider’s drive history, including drives too old for Spotlight. For one drive in detail, use the Get Drive Details tool." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
