            "value" : "Activa (true) o desactiva (false) el Modo Defensa Biológica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set true to turn max defrost on, or false to turn max defrost off." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activa (true) o desactiva (false) el desempañado máximo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sets the maximum battery state-of-charge percentage (50% to 100%) at which charging stops on a Tesla vehicle, after user confirmation. Use 80% for typical daily driving or up to 100% before long road trips." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Establece el límite máximo de carga (50% a 100%) de un Tesla tras confirmar. Usa 80% a diario o hasta 100% antes de viajes largos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sets the maximum current the car draws while AC charging, in amps, to charge more slowly or share a circuit. It doesn't change the charge limit; use Set Tesla Charge Limit (or Control Car) for that. Doesn't affect Supercharging." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fija la corriente máxima de carga CA en amperios. No cambia el límite de carga ni afecta a Superchargers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
