    "Warmest battery module temperature, in degrees Fahrenheit." : {
      "comment" : "FleetKit Siri/Shortcuts label from FleetStatsEntities.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temperatura del módulo más cálido de la batería, en grados Fahrenheit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warms up or cools down the user's car (or Tesla) in one step: cabin temperature, max defrost, seat heat, the steering wheel heater, Dog Mode, and Bioweapon Defense Mode. Turns climate on. Use when the user asks for more than one climate change, or to warm up, cool down, or precondition their car before leaving." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calienta o enfría el Tesla en un paso: temperatura, desempañado, asientos, volante, Modo Perro y Defensa Biológica. Úsalo para varios ajustes climáticos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warms up, cools down, or preconditions the user's car or Tesla by starting cabin HVAC at its current setpoint. Use for requests like \"warm up my car\", \"cool down my car\", or \"warm up my Tesla\". Use Set Car Temperature for a target temperature, or Control Car for multi-setting prep." : {
      "comment" : "App Intent or parameter description used by Siri and Shortcuts.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calienta, enfría o preacondiciona el Tesla encendiendo el clima a su temperatura actual. Usa Ajustar temperatura o Controlar vehículo para más opciones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
